      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF-02 Candidate Processing\n**Intake** (called by WF-01): `api.submit_application` runs one transaction that upserts the candidate, detects duplicates and creates the application (NEW -> VALIDATING -> VALIDATED / SCREENING_REVIEW). A replayed event returns its stored result. It then sends exactly one acknowledgement per event (SWF-02 dedupe key).\n**Action SEND_REJECTION_NOTICE** (called by WF-00): re-checks that the application is still REJECTED before emailing.\nFailures go to SWF-03 with replay target WF-02.",
        "color": 6
      }
    }
